; The protocol core: no I/O, no scheduler, no unix. Everything here is a pure
; function or a state machine the transport adapters drive, which is what lets
; the same code serve Unix sockets and a Solo5 unikernel, and lets the test
; suite exercise dispatch with the identity monad and no scheduler at all.

